Third-party code vendored here, unmodified, and inlined into every built
deck so a page works offline with no network fetch.

  mp4-muxer.min.js   mp4-muxer 5.2.1    MIT    https://www.npmjs.com/package/mp4-muxer
  webm-muxer.min.js  webm-muxer 5.1.2   MIT    https://www.npmjs.com/package/webm-muxer

Both files are the jsDelivr Terser builds; the header comment naming the
original npm path is left intact at the top of each. They provide the
Mp4Muxer and WebMMuxer globals that the deck's frame-exact WebCodecs export
writes into. They are MIT licensed, which is not the licence of this
repository, so they stay in this directory and keep their own terms. To
refresh one, download the same build from jsDelivr and replace the file
whole; do not edit it by hand.
